<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Uganda's Scenic Beauty - Discover Pearl of Africa</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="logo">🌍 Uganda Scenic</div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#destinations">Destinations</a></li>
                <li><a href="#wildlife">Wildlife</a></li>
                <li><a href="#culture">Culture</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section id="home" class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>The Pearl of Africa</h1>
            <p>Discover Uganda's Breathtaking Landscapes and Natural Wonders</p>
            <button class="cta-button">Explore Now</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Destinations Section -->
    <section id="destinations" class="destinations">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Iconic Destinations</h2>
            
            <div class="destination-grid">
                <div class="destination-card">
                    <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);"></div>
                    <h3>Bwindi Impenetrable National Park</h3>
                    <p>Home to over half of the world's remaining mountain gorillas. Trek through misty forests and witness these magnificent creatures in their natural habitat.</p>
                    <ul class="highlights">
                        <li>✓ Mountain Gorilla Trekking</li>
                        <li>✓ Lush Forest Canopy</li>
                        <li>✓ Diverse Bird Species</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="destination-card">
                    <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);"></div>
                    <h3>Rwenzori Mountains</h3>
                    <p>Africa's third highest mountain range with snow-capped peaks, glaciers, and pristine alpine lakes. Perfect for adventure seekers and mountaineers.</p>
                    <ul class="highlights">
                        <li>✓ Snow-Capped Peaks</li>
                        <li>✓ Alpine Meadows</li>
                        <li>✓ Mountain Trekking</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="destination-card">
                    <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%);"></div>
                    <h3>Lake Victoria</h3>
                    <p>The world's second-largest freshwater lake offering stunning sunsets, island adventures, and vibrant fishing communities.</p>
                    <ul class="highlights">
                        <li>✓ Sunset Cruises</li>
                        <li>✓ Island Exploration</li>
                        <li>✓ Water Activities</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="destination-card">
                    <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #43e97b 0%, #38f9d7 100%);"></div>
                    <h3>Queen Elizabeth National Park</h3>
                    <p>Diverse ecosystems featuring tree-climbing lions, hippos, buffalo, and incredible birdwatching opportunities along the Kazinga Channel.</p>
                    <ul class="highlights">
                        <li>✓ Tree-Climbing Lions</li>
                        <li>✓ Big Five Safari</li>
                        <li>✓ Boat Cruises</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="destination-card">
                    <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%);"></div>
                    <h3>Murchison Falls</h3>
                    <p>Witness the world's most powerful waterfall where the Victoria Nile forces through a 7-meter gap with incredible force and mist.</p>
                    <ul class="highlights">
                        <li>✓ Powerful Waterfalls</li>
                        <li>✓ Safari Drives</li>
                        <li>✓ River Cruises</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="destination-card">
                    <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8edea 0%, #fed6e3 100%);"></div>
                    <h3>Kabale Region</h3>
                    <p>Rolling hills covered in terraced gardens creating one of Africa's most picturesque landscapes, perfect for hiking and cultural immersion.</p>
                    <ul class="highlights">
                        <li>✓ Terraced Hills</li>
                        <li>✓ Scenic Hikes</li>
                        <li>✓ Local Culture</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Wildlife Section -->
    <section id="wildlife" class="wildlife">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Amazing Wildlife</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Uganda is home to incredible biodiversity with over 1,080 bird species and abundant wildlife.</p>
            
            <div class="wildlife-grid">
                <div class="wildlife-item">
                    <div class="wildlife-icon">🦍</div>
                    <h4>Mountain Gorillas</h4>
                    <p>Gentle giants found in Bwindi and Mgahinga forests</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wildlife-item">
                    <div class="wildlife-icon">🦁</div>
                    <h4>African Lions</h4>
                    <p>Including the rare tree-climbing lions of Queen Elizabeth</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wildlife-item">
                    <div class="wildlife-icon">🦣</div>
                    <h4>Elephants</h4>
                    <p>Roaming through national parks and protected areas</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wildlife-item">
                    <div class="wildlife-icon">🦒</div>
                    <h4>Giraffes</h4>
                    <p>Graceful inhabitants of the savanna landscapes</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wildlife-item">
                    <div class="wildlife-icon">🦓</div>
                    <h4>Zebras</h4>
                    <p>Striped herds roaming across open plains</p>
                </div>
                <div class="wildlife-item">
                    <div class="wildlife-icon">🦅</div>
                    <h4>Birds</h4>
                    <p>Over 1,000 species including eagles and kingfishers</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Culture Section -->
    <section id="culture" class="culture">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Rich Cultural Heritage</h2>
            <div class="culture-content">
                <div class="culture-text">
                    <h3>Meet the People of Uganda</h3>
                    <p>Uganda is home to over 50 ethnic groups, each with unique traditions, languages, and customs. Experience authentic cultural encounters:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>The Baganda:</strong> Kingdoms with rich monarchies and traditions</li>
                        <li><strong>The Karamojong:</strong> Pastoral communities with distinctive warrior cultures</li>
                        <li><strong>The Batwa:</strong> Indigenous forest dwellers with deep connections to nature</li>
                        <li><strong>The Acholi:</strong> Northern communities known for vibrant music and dance</li>
                        <li><strong>The Bakonzo:</strong> Mountain dwellers of the Rwenzori region</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Visit traditional villages, learn crafts, taste local cuisine, and participate in cultural ceremonies that celebrate Uganda's diverse heritage.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Travel Tips Section -->
    <section class="travel-tips">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Travel Essentials</h2>
            <div class="tips-grid">
                <div class="tip-card">
                    <h4>📅 Best Time to Visit</h4>
                    <p>Dry seasons: June-August and December-February offer the best wildlife viewing and hiking conditions.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-card">
                    <h4>💵 Currency & Budget</h4>
                    <p>Ugandan Shilling (UGX). Uganda offers excellent value for travelers compared to other African destinations.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-card">
                    <h4>✈️ Getting There</h4>
                    <p>Entebbe International Airport is the main gateway. Regular flights from Europe, Africa, and the Middle East.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-card">
                    <h4>🏥 Health & Safety</h4>
                    <p>Consult your doctor for vaccinations. Uganda is generally safe for tourists in designated areas.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-card">
                    <h4>🌡️ Climate</h4>
                    <p>Tropical climate near the equator. Pack layers and rain gear. Temperatures vary by altitude.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-card">
                    <h4>🗣️ Languages</h4>
                    <p>English and Swahili are widely spoken. Over 40 local languages reflect Uganda's diversity.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section -->
    <section id="contact" class="contact">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Plan Your Adventure</h2>
            <form class="contact-form">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                <textarea placeholder="Tell us about your dream trip..." rows="5" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="cta-button">Send Inquiry</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Uganda Scenic Beauty. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Discover the Pearl of Africa • Explore • Experience • Connect</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
